<title>HONG KONG: Cho Hung Bank sets US$200 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>Cho Hung Bank sets US$200 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Fuji International Finance.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHO HUNG BANK</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$200 MLN  COUPON    6ML+20 BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRN	   ISS PRICE PAR	  RE-OFFER  --</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES   22.NOV.96</p>
<p> LISTING  LUXEMBOURG  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS $100K,10K,1K</p>
<p> RATING   *	     PAY FREQ  SEMIANNUALLLY</p>
<p>SALES LMTS US/UK/HK/JAPAN/SINGAPORE/KOREA Reg S, 144A eligible</p>
<p> NEG PLG  YES	   CRS DEF   YES	  FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW  NEW YORK    HOME CTRY S.KOREA    PAY DATE  09.DEC.96</p>
<p> FEES     10  BP	MGT	 5 BP	 SELLING   5 BP</p>
<p> NOTE     *CHO HUNG BANK IS RATED A3 BY MOODY'S</p>
<p> LEADS     CITIBANK INTERNATIONAL AND FUJI INTERNATIONAL</p>
<p>	     FINANCE (HONG KONG)</p>
<p>--Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
